  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>SCATTER</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>HIDDEN SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>Fire Blast Re-Spin</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>Frozen Wild Re-Spin</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>Mystery Re-Spin</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>Fire Storm Free Games</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '- Fire Wild appears on reel 1 only and substitutes for all symbols except         .

      - Ice Wild appears on reel 5 only and substitutes for all symbols except         .'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: 3 Scatters on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers <style=coinColor><size=25>Fire
      Storm Free Games.</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '               appears on all reels. At the end of each spin, all Hidden
      Symbols on the reels reveal the same random symbol. It could turn to any symbol
      except                       and         . '
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: '- When Fire Wild lands on reel1 as a full stack, Fire Blast Re-Spin is
      triggered.

      - Fire Wild becomes locked and 3 re-spins are awarded.

      - Re-spin counter resets whenever there''s any win.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "- When Ice Wild lands on reel5 as a full stack, Frozen Wild Re-Spin is
      triggered.\r\n- Ice Wild becomes locked and 5 re-spins are awarded.\r\n- Any
      high symbol appeared on reels becomes locked until the end of Frozen Wild Re-Spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_6
    value: '- When partial or as a full stack, Fire and Ice Wild land on reels 1 and
      5 respectively, they nudge and Mystery Re-Spin is triggered.

      - Both Wilds become locked and 5 re-spins are awarded.

      - Any Hidden Symbol appeared on reels becomes locked until the end of Mystery
      Re-Spin.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_7
    value: '- 3 Scatters on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers Fire Storm Free Games.

      - Each Scatter awards extra Free Game.

      - During Fire Storm Free Games, only Fire Wild and Scatter appear on reel 1.

      - At the end of Mystery Re-Spin, a Special Wheel appears and awards a multiplier
      to the wins collected throughout the Mystery Re-Spin.

      - Fire Blast Re-Spin and Frozen Wild Re-Spin are not possible to trigger during
      Fire Strom Free Games.'
  - key: SIGN_BOARD_WIN_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '{0} {1} wins {2:CommaNumber}X{3} = {4:CommaNumber}'
  - key: SIGN_BOARD_WIN_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '{0} {1} wins {2:CommaNumber}'
